<%- include('partials/top') %><section class="dash-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">PAYOUT REQUEST</span><h1>Withdraw funds.</h1><p>Withdrawals are reviewed manually by the administrator.</p></div><div class="balance-chip"><small>Available balance</small><b><%= formatNaira(u.balance) %></b></div></section><% if(!open){ %><div class="notice notice-error">The withdrawal portal is currently closed by the administrator.</div><% } %><div class="two-col"><section class="content-card"><div class="content-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">BANK DETAILS</span><h2>Where should we send it?</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/profile">Edit details ↗</a></div><form action="/withdraw" method="post" class="stack-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Withdrawal amount (₦)<input type="number" name="amount" min="<%= min %>" max="<%= u.balance %>" step="1" required placeholder="Minimum <%= formatNaira(min) %>"></label><label>Account name<input name="account_name" required value="<%= u.bank_account_name %>" maxlength="120"></label><label>Account number<input name="account_number" required inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{8,20}" value="<%= u.bank_account_number %>" maxlength="20"></label><label>Bank name<input name="bank_name" required value="<%= u.bank_name %>" maxlength="120"></label><div class="form-hint">Requested funds are reserved while pending. If rejected, the amount is returned to your balance. Approval records the request; the bank transfer must still be completed separately.</div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-full" <%= !open?'disabled':'' %>>Submit withdrawal request ↗</button></form></section><aside class="side-note"><span class="quick-icon">✓</span><h3>Before you submit</h3><p>Double-check every bank detail. A wrong account number can cause payment delays or a failed transfer.</p><a class="text-link" href="/history">Check request status ↗</a></aside></div><%- include('partials/bottom') %>
